<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" pages="4">
  <diagram name="TITLE" id="KUYRH8v3RPsHJvHAJ2Jf">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1285" dy="644" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="GSimsx3UyKqEXXrwUyFO-1" parent="1" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;imageBorder=default;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="840" x="5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="GSimsx3UyKqEXXrwUyFO-2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;DESCRIPTION:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Establishes a series of architectural models that span multiple aspects of the overall codemelted.rs Project. Mermaid models will support specific implementations while this drawing package will capture architectural models each language implementation (Rust / JavaScript / PowerShell) will adhere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;ENGINEER:&lt;/b&gt; Mark Shaffer&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;VERSION:&lt;/b&gt; v26.2.0&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;MODIFICATION HISTORY&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;2026-AUG-10 / v26.2.0 / M. Shaffer:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Establishes the overall design notes for the next series of breaking refactors of the codemelted.js and codmeleted.rs into a multi-module system to support TAURI bindings and WASM build&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="830" width="840" x="5" y="270" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="GSimsx3UyKqEXXrwUyFO-3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;" value="codemelted.rs Project Architectural Design" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="840" x="5" y="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="Q0MUYvC4C3lPPcSlcYbw" name="INTRODUCTION">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1571" dy="787" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="Bbl6pxC9RSyDbMBB58do-9" connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;fillColor=#f5f5f5;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;strokeColor=#666666;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1100" width="842" x="4" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Bbl6pxC9RSyDbMBB58do-5" parent="Bbl6pxC9RSyDbMBB58do-9" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontFamily=Courier New;strokeColor=#666666;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;INTRODUCTION&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Purpose&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div&gt;The purpose of this document is to establish overall architectural models of the codemelted.rs project. The project exists in three major parts. The Rust modules establish the core of the project implementing raw memory safe implementations of the fourteen domain use cases discussed later in this package. The JavaScript modules provide several purposes. The first is the overall wrapping of Web APIs available in all Browser runtimes to implement the applicable domain use cases. The second is the JavaScript will support TypeScript by providing a robust set of types via JSDoc and higher level abstracted constructs. This allows for the JavaScript to be consumed primarily for web app / site development along with exposing some of those modules to the various JavaScript runtimes (Bun / Deno / Node / Worker). Finally, the JavaScript modules will provide Rust with the ability to create Desktop / Mobile application via TAURI. This provides the bindings necessary to have a WebView HTML / CSS frontend and utilize JavaScript to reach into the Rust implementation of the domain use cases that are specific to a given operating system. The final language is PowerShell. The Rust modules will implement a native &lt;b&gt;codemelted&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;native command usable in any operating system terminal. PowerShell will provide a wrapper allowing for scripting / building complex terminal scripts, CLI, or Textual User Interface (TUI) applications.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Scope&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div&gt;The models captured herein will be utilized in each of the implementing programming language SDKs with those SDKs establishing how they fit into the overall architecture of this project. It will also support the &lt;b&gt;codemelted.rs Project Developer&#39;s Guide&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;establishing any models which document an aspect to this overall project not reflected within mermaid diagrams. Mermaid diagrams will support modeling of the individual programming languages and relationships to any third party plugins for the given programming language and will not be reflected within this package.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1069.94" width="842" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Bbl6pxC9RSyDbMBB58do-6" connectable="0" parent="Bbl6pxC9RSyDbMBB58do-9" style="group" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="842" y="1070" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Bbl6pxC9RSyDbMBB58do-1" parent="Bbl6pxC9RSyDbMBB58do-6" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="codemelted.rs Architectural Design" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="29.765625" width="842" y="0.234375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Bbl6pxC9RSyDbMBB58do-2" parent="Bbl6pxC9RSyDbMBB58do-6" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;imageBorder=default;" value="" vertex="1">
